# Live-preview OAuth client secret for the shared broker client (id: grok_preview).
# Set this to the broker's GROK_PREVIEW_CLIENT_SECRET when you want real sign-in
# on a *.grok-sandbox.com preview. Nothing is committed here, and the app does
# not fall back to a built-in secret.
#
# Deployed apps set GROK_AUTH_CLIENT_SECRET instead. That value wins over this one.
GROK_PREVIEW_CLIENT_SECRET=
